{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14107070","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1410707001:1":{"text":"まさか本当にあったなんて！間違いない、あれは……ドゥアガルだ！","source_cn":"真的在这里！杜恩加尔……是杜恩加尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5078E2B9965FE66C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410707002:1":{"text":"フリンの野郎！どうりであんなに自信満々だったんだな、まさかドゥアガルを手に入れていたとは……","source_cn":"弗林！这可恶的小老头……怪不得他对复活赫托信心十足……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9316B843EA2F8620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410707003:1":{"text":"いったん落ち着くんだ。偽物という可能性もあるだろう。","source_cn":"你冷静下来仔细看看，我怀疑只是个仿品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54812E3F9D43045A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410707004:1":{"text":"オレの目を疑うのか！？あれは、ヘクト様が竜炎で作った武器に間違いない！","source_cn":"轮不到你怀疑！我相信我的眼睛！错不了，那可是赫托亲手用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54305D097FA0EB4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410707005:1":{"text":"オレは魔法はさっぱりだが……この距離からでも、ドゥアガルの放つ凄まじい波動をビンビン感じるよ！","source_cn":"即便离得这么远，即便不懂魔法……我也能感受到它散发出来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9297ED11322E599B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410707006:1":{"text":"あれを模倣するなんてあり得ない！あそこにあるのは本物のドゥアガルだ！","source_cn":"杜恩加尔根本不可能被仿造！毋庸置疑，那是真品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12365D1176398571","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410707007:1":{"text":"妙だな……あの弓から闇の気配を感じるのだ……","source_cn":"怪了……那把弓上附有阴暗黏腻的气息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6DFF8633950F09E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410707008:1":{"text":"微かなものだが、とても神の力とは思えない。","source_cn":"虽然气息很微弱，但我认为那绝对不是神明的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75EE0F20CF97276","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1410707008":{"text":"微かなものだが、とても神の力とは思えない。","source_cn":"虽然气息很微弱，但我认为那绝对不是神明的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75EE0F20CF97276","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410707009:1":{"text":"いや、私は陛下の魔力を知っている。両者は全くの別物だ。","source_cn":"我熟悉女王的魔力，二者并不相似，不是女王。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DEAB897148B59D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:14107